@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_37_1_Loop IntroBgmPath:Bgm_37_1_Intro Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

# Judge8-12-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal2,ArmR1,ArmL4,Eyes2_Normal_Open1,Mouth2_Determined_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:安安故意从<br>阳台坠落的<br>时候，<br>就着手把自己伪装成<br>已经死去的模样。|#0203Trial12_Hiro001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal2,ArmR1,ArmL4,Eyes2_Normal_Open1,Mouth2_Determined_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:她会这样做<br>有可能是出于<br>恶作剧的想法。<br>……可是<br>有人利用了她这个<br>准备周详的计划。|#0203Trial12_Hiro002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal2,ArmR1,ArmL4,Eyes2_Normal_Open3,Mouth2_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这个人先把铁栅栏的铁栅<br>弄断备好，<br>等安安掉下来时<br>把她刺死……|#0203Trial12_Hiro003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal2,ArmR1,ArmL4,Eyes2_Normal_Open3,Mouth2_Determined_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:然后<br>让中庭下一场雨，<br>把自己犯案的痕迹<br>冲洗干净。|#0203Trial12_Hiro004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal2,ArmR1,ArmL4,Eyes2_Normal_Closed1,Mouth2_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:能做到这件事的，<br>就只有能够使用操控液体<br>这一魔法的人……|#0203Trial12_Hiro005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal2,ArmR6,ArmL3,Eyes2_Angry_Open1,Mouth2_Determined_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:城崎诺亚……<br>凶手就是你。|#0203Trial12_Hiro006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那只是希罗你<br>单方面的臆测<br>而已吧？|#0203Trial12_Noah001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:因为希罗刚才<br>不也说了嘛。<br>【犯案的痕迹已经冲洗干净】。|#0203Trial12_Noah002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"既然现场没有<br>留下任何证据，<br>那就什么都<br><link=\"Objection_02_03_12_01\">证明不了</link>，<br>没错吧。|#0203Trial12_Noah003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:说不定这一切<br>全都是希罗<br>幻想出来的，<br>其实安安<br>坠下中庭时<br>就已经死了。|#0203Trial12_Noah004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR8,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:可、<br>可希罗已经证明了<br>血迹是伪造的啊……！|#0203Trial12_Ema001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR3,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"诺亚觉得<br>这证明不了什么吧……<br>而且就算是假血，<br>应该<link=\"Objection_02_03_12_02\">谁都能</link><br>弄到吧。|#0203Trial12_Noah005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR2,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open_1,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"说不定那场雨<br>只是<link=\"Objection_02_03_12_03\">碰巧</link>下的，<br>再说，<br>要往中庭里洒水，<br>办法不是<br>要多少有多少吗？|#0203Trial12_Noah006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR2,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:然后呢，除了诺亚以外，<br>其他人不也<br>没有不在场证明嘛？|#0203Trial12_Noah007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal2,ArmR6,Arms3,Eyes2_Angry_Open1,Mouth2_Determined_Open2,Sweat2-1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……即便如此，<br>也推翻不了<br>只有诺亚<br>能清除脚印的事实。|#0203Trial12_Hiro007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Flushed_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:真的吗？确定吗？|#0203Trial12_Noah008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR4,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"比如说，<link=\"Objection_02_03_12_04\">蕾雅</link>是第一个<br>踏进中庭的人，<br>那她就<br>没有必要在<br>犯案后清除脚印了。|#0203Trial12_Noah009|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR2,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:既然是第一发现人，<br>留了脚印也很正常啊。<br>|#0203Trial12_Noah010| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR5,ArmL7,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……说得对。<br>所以现场确实<br>留下了我的脚印。|#0203Trial12_Leia001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……你看吧？|#0203Trial12_Noah011| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open_1,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:希罗的推理<br>都很反常，<br>构图简直一团糟……|#0203Trial12_Noah012| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

