@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR5,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:在诺亚看来，<br>不管是透视还是焦点……<br>全都不对劲哦？|#0203Trial12_Noah013| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


